#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential Vault"
msgstr "Tahiry voaro fahazoan-dalana"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Vault Key File"
msgstr "Rakitra fanalahidin'ny tahiry voaro"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key that encrypts stored credentials. Create it yourself, outside the web root, readable only by the web server and poller user, in a directory that only root and that user can write (the same applies to credential files); the plugin never creates or writes it. Back it up with the database: without it, stored credentials must be entered again."
msgstr "Lalana feno mankany amin'ny fanalahidy 32-byte izay manafina ny fahazoan-dalana voatahiry. Forony manokana izany, ivelan'ny fakan'ny tranonkala, azo vakian'ny mpizara tranonkala sy ny mpampiasa poller ihany, ao anaty lahatahiry izay ny root sy io mpampiasa io ihany no afaka manoratra ao (mitovy amin'izany koa ny rakitra fahazoan-dalana); tsy mamorona na manoratra izany velively ny plugin. Ataovy tahiry fiarovana miaraka amin'ny angon-drakitra izany: raha tsy misy azy, tsy maintsy ampidirina indray ny fahazoan-dalana voatahiry."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential File Directory"
msgstr "Lahatahiry misy ny rakitra fahazoan-dalana"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the directory that holds credential files. An account can read its credential from a file only inside it, never the vault key file. Empty, the default, refuses credential files. Cloud Admin chooses the file, so keep only cloud credentials here."
msgstr "Lalana feno mankany amin'ny lahatahiry mitazona ny rakitra fahazoan-dalana. Ny kaonty dia afaka mamaky ny fahazoan-dalany avy amin'ny rakitra ao anatiny ihany, fa tsy ny rakitra fanalahidin'ny tahiry voaro velively. Raha banga, izay no mahazatra, dia mandà ny rakitra fahazoan-dalana. Ny Mpitantana Cloud no misafidy ny rakitra, koa tehirizo eto ny fahazoan-dalana Cloud ihany."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector"
msgstr "Mpanangona"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Time Budget"
msgstr "Fetram-potoana ho an'ny mpanangona"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one collector run may spend before it stops starting new work. Keep it below the poller interval; unfinished accounts resume on the next run."
msgstr "Segondra azo lanian'ny fampandehanana mpanangona iray alohan'ny hijanonany tsy hanomboka asa vaovao. Ataovy latsaky ny elanelam-potoanan'ny poller izany; mitohy amin'ny fampandehanana manaraka ny kaonty tsy vita."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Fanesorana"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Tazomy ny tabilaon'ny plugin rehefa manaisotra"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its accounts, encrypted credentials, and cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them. Cloud resources are never touched either way."
msgstr "Rehefa voamarika, ny fanesorana ny plugin dia mitazona ny kaontiny, ny fahazoan-dalana voaaro, ary ny cache. Esory ny marika mba hamafan'ny fanesorana azy ireo. Tsy voakasika mihitsy ny loharano Cloud na amin'ny fomba ahoana na amin'ny fomba ahoana."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "Not verified yet."
msgstr "Tsy mbola nohamarinina."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The credential works and has the permissions this account needs."
msgstr "Miasa ny fahazoan-dalana ary manana ny alalana ilain'ity kaonty ity."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider rejected the credential. It may be wrong, expired, or revoked."
msgstr "Nolavin'ny mpanome tolotra ny fahazoan-dalana. Mety ho diso, lany daty, na nofoanana izany."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The credential works but lacks a permission this account needs."
msgstr "Miasa ny fahazoan-dalana saingy tsy ampy alalana ilain'ity kaonty ity."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider could not be reached. Check the network path and outbound policy from the poller."
msgstr "Tsy azo nifandraisana ny mpanome tolotra. Hamarino ny lalan'ny tambajotra sy ny fitsipika mivoaka avy amin'ny poller."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider is throttling requests. Try again later."
msgstr "Mametra ny fangatahana ny mpanome tolotra. Andramo indray afaka kelikely."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider sent a response the plugin could not read."
msgstr "Nandefa valiny tsy azon'ny plugin novakiana ny mpanome tolotra."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The account or its credential is not configured correctly."
msgstr "Tsy voakarakara tsara ny kaonty na ny fahazoan-dalany."

